		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Codeplug for the RT3S/MD-UV380 for Australia]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3323&amp;p=26513#p26513"><![CDATA[
A full codeplug for the Retevis RT3S and MD-UV380 for Australia. Contains all VK DMR and Brandmeister repeaters, all VK FM repeaters, 3 Hotspot channels (SImplex, Duplex and Brandmeister), UHF CB and VHF Marine. It also include all VKDMR compatible talk groups and a range of useful intenational Brandmeister talk groups. Repeaters and Hotspots are sorted into Zones which includes a 'Local Rptrs' zone where you can add your local repeater channels for easy access.<br><br>The codeplug has been created from scratch with all repeaters confirmed from the VKDMR &amp; Brandmeister dashboards and latest Repeater Book database. All repeaters are geocoded with their location allowing the radio to display its distance to the selected repeater (set 'Menu', 'Options', 'Display Options', 'Show Dist:' to 'On').<br><br><a href="https://vk2idl.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/OpenGD77_RT3S_Generic_24_Sept_2023.zip" class="postlink">https://vk2idl.com/wp-content/uploads/2 ... t_2023.zip</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=4493">VK2GL</a> — Sun Sep 24, 2023 9:01 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
